  "description": "The 37 volt Unisex Skute Folding Electric-Scooter from Hyper is perfect for cruising around your neighborhood or downtown. Enjoy the benefits of using a scooter with assistance from the electronic motor and brake! The Skute E-Scooter has a portable folding design for easy storage at home or even in a car. The LCD Display includes a speedometer, a battery life indicator, and a total distance measurement. The speed lever offers 3 speeds of 6 mph, 9 mph, and a maximum of 16 mph. Complete with LED headlights and rear lights, you can even go riding around your neighborhood at night! This scooter has a maximum distance per charge of 8 miles and a max weight of 176 lbs. The 8-inch solid tires in the front and rear and the rear fender brake complete this fun e-scooter. UL certified.",
